# Rust / Tauri testing

Read `.cursor/skills/rust-tauri-testing/SKILL.md` when adding behavior.

## Always

- Unit tests for policy/crypto/domain
- Integration tests with `tempfile` / `wiremock` / fake stores
- Cover rejection + recovery for pairing and security flows

## Never

- Require live network or real OS keyring for unit tests
- Ship critical IPC changes with zero automated coverage

## Prefer

- Injectable traits for secret stores and HTTP
- WebDriver E2E for release-critical UI paths (optional in PR, required over time)
